        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 63,
          "text": "Refer to POL-ORD-003 v2.0 for the revised delegation of authority matrix and thresholds."
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 90,
          "text": "7. Exceptions and Escalation"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 114,
          "text": "Deviations require Regional Finance Head approval, with escalation to Group Finance for exceptions exceeding"
        },
        {
          "block_type": "line",
          "top": 129,
          "text": "$100,000 in order value."
        },
        {
